B.Kj=s(["Interactive 3D isometric building model with 360-degree orbit and section tap zoom","Millimeter-accurate 2D architectural CAD floor blueprints (Ground Floor & Terrace)","Automated BOQ construction budget & materials estimator in Pakistani Rupee (PKR)","Subcontinental and global land standards: Marla (225 / 250 / 272 sq ft), Kanal, Sq Ft, Gaj","AI-powered architectural program customization: plot frontage, depth, and road facing","Comprehensive material specification reports: RCC concrete frame, UPVC windows, porcelain tiles"],t.s)
B.OO=new A.jF("AI Architect","3D building & floor planning studio with AI layout generation, interactive isometric visualization, and BOQ cost estimation.",B.Kg,u.A,"AI Architect is a modern 3D building and floor planning studio designed to transform plot dimensions into intelligent, livable architectural floor plans and interactive 3D models before construction. Featuring localized subcontinental land unit support (Marla, Kanal, Sq Ft, Gaj), 6+ modern villa layout variations, and real-time structural BOQ construction cost estimation in PKR Lakhs.",B.Kj)
B.JR=s(["Flutter","Provider","Google MlKit","Local Storage","Charts"],t.s)
B.Jv=s(["Google MLKit camera receipt & invoice OCR auto-scanner","Smart automated expense categorization & monthly budgets","Interactive visual charts (FL Chart) spending breakdown","Fast offline-first Local Storage (SQLite / Hive)","Multi-currency support aur monthly overspending alerts"],t.s)
B.OK=new A.jF("Ai Expense Tracker",u.c,B.JR,"assets/images/expense_tracker_logo.png","Ai Expense Tracker ek intelligent personal finance application hai jo AI-driven OCR (Google MLKit) ke zariye manual data entry ko khatam karti hai. Receipts scan kar ke kharchon ko categorize karti hai aur visual spending charts provide karti hai. Fast local storage ke sath offline-first architecture par mabni hai.",B.Jv)
B.K8=s(["Flutter","Provider","Firebase","Cloudinary","FCM"],t.s)
B.Jd=s(["Dedicated 3-role portals: Tailor, Client, and Admin control dashboard","Tailor catalog upload with Cloudinary CDN high-resolution image optimization","Category-based client browsing and custom body measurement order placement","Real-time order acceptance workflow with instant FCM push notifications","Live interactive order lifecycle progress tracking for clients","Comprehensive Admin management panel for all users, tailors, and orders"],t.s)
B.OJ=new A.jF("Stitch&Witch","Bespoke tailoring platform with dedicated Tailor, Client & Admin portals and real-time live order tracking.",B.K8,"assets/images/stitch_logo.png","Stitch&Witch is an end-to-end bespoke fashion and tailoring platform featuring 3 dedicated role portals: Tailor, Client, and Admin. Tailors upload product catalogs with high-res photos to Cloudinary CDN, categorized in the Client app. Clients place custom measurement orders, tailors accept requests in real-time, and clients receive live interactive order tracking powered by Firebase Firestore and FCM notifications.",B.Jd)
B.Ky=s(["Flutter","Provider","Firebase","ZegoCloud","FCM"],t.s)
B.Ia=s(["Screen flow: Splash screen \u2794 Firebase Auth \u2794 Home communication dashboard","User discovery with name search and permission-gated friend request flow","Anti-spam connection lock: Messaging unlocks only when friend request is accepted","Ephemeral Status & Stories system visible exclusively to accepted friends","High-Definition voice and video calling powered by ZegoCloud RTC SDK","Architected with Provider state management, Firebase Firestore, and FCM push notifications"],t.s)
B.OM=new A.jF("ChatFlow","Real-time communication app with connection-gated messaging, stories/status updates, and ZegoCloud calling.",B.Ky,"assets/images/chatflow_logo.png","ChatFlow features a complete onboarding and communication pipeline: Splash \u2794 Firebase Auth \u2794 Home dashboard. Users search other users by name and send connection requests. Direct messaging is strictly locked until the recipient accepts the request. Friends can view and share ephemeral status stories, chat in real-time, and launch crystal-clear HD audio and video calls powered by ZegoCloud with Provider state management and FCM push notifications.",B.Ia)
B.J4=s(["Flutter","Provider","Firebase","OpenStreetMap","Live Tracking"],t.s)
B.J3=s(["Seamless user flow from Splash screen directly to Home map screen","One-place-to-another real-time live GPS route movement tracking","High-performance OpenStreetMap (OSM) vector rendering with custom markers","Dynamic route polylines with speed, heading, and distance metrics","Architected with Provider state management and Firebase real-time data sync","Battery-optimized location streams with smart distance thresholds"],t.s)
B.ON=new A.jF("Locki",u.E,B.J4,"assets/images/locki_logo.png","Locki is a real-time GPS location tracking and navigation app that features a clean flow from Splash screen to the interactive Home map. It enables continuous point-to-point live tracking from one place to another using OpenStreetMap (OSM) for open-source vector mapping, Provider for battery-optimized GPS updates, and Firebase Firestore for real-time live coordinate synchronization.",B.J3)
B.JC=s(["Flutter","Provider","AI Summarizer","Voice & Video Notes","Firebase","Cloudinary"],t.s)
B.Kn=s(["AI Smart Summarizer: Converts long articles and meeting notes into concise bullet summaries","Smart Title Generator: Creates professional, catchy, and meaningful note headings tailored to content","Flawless Clarity & Tone: Polishes sentence structure, grammar, and flow for executive reading","Multimedia Note Suite: Text notes, real-time waveform Audio Memos, and direct Video notes","Fast Search & Filter: Instant keyword search and date-based note directory filtering","Cloud Architecture: Firebase Auth, real-time Firestore sync, and Cloudinary media streaming"],t.s)
B.OL=new A.jF("Ai NoteZilla",u.u,B.JC,u.z,"Ai NoteZilla is an intelligent AI-assisted notes and productivity suite featuring instant smart article summarization, automated title generation, and grammar/tone clarity polishing. Beyond rich text notes, users can record voice memos with real-time waveform visualization and capture video notes uploaded seamlessly to Cloudinary CDN with Firebase synchronization.",B.Kn)
B.Kk=s(["Flutter","Provider","Local Storage","Thermal Printing","Dual Portals"],t.s)
B.I9=s(["Dual portal architecture: Dedicated Admin and Cashier terminals","Admin portal: Product/item registration, barcode cataloging, and cashier management","Cashier terminal: Lightning-fast billing, cart discount calculation, and checkout","Thermal receipt printing: Integrated ESC/POS Bluetooth and USB printer support","Offline-First Local Storage (SQLite / Hive) ensuring zero-delay retail transactions","Role-based authentication securing administrative store configuration"],t.s)
B.OI=new A.jF("Matrix POS",u.n,B.Kk,"assets/images/matrix_pos_card_banner.png","Matrix POS is an offline-first retail Point-of-Sale system built with Role-Based Authentication and 2 dedicated portals: Admin and Cashier. The Admin portal allows store owners to register inventory items and onboard cashier staff. The Cashier portal enables fast retail checkout, automatic cart totals, and physical receipt printing via Bluetooth/USB thermal printers. Powered by high-speed Local Storage, it operates without internet delays.",B.I9)
